&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We&amp;nbsp;take play seriously. We’re looking for curious adventurers ready to find their party, fueled by imagination&amp;nbsp;and drive&amp;nbsp;to build what’s never been built before. At Hasbro and Wizards of the Coast, you’ll collaborate with passionate teams to reimagine our iconic brands and create experiences that spark joy, connection, and community through the magic of play. This is your chance to shape legendary play that lasts a lifetime.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help fans discover—and rediscover—the brands they love.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bring your curiosity, ideas and point of view to teams creating products, games and experiences enjoyed by fans around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;One application. Many ways to play.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Apply once to this general application for consideration for anticipated 2027 Marketing internships in Boston, Massachusetts and/or Renton, Washington.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not one specific vacancy. Projects are confirmed on a rolling basis, and one application puts you in consideration across multiple opportunities with participating teams and brands. You do not need to submit separate applications for each team or brand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If your profile aligns with a specific internship project, a recruiter may contact you directly with details and next steps. Applying does not guarantee an interview or placement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About Hasbro&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hasbro creates joy and community through the magic of play. Across Hasbro, Wizards of the Coast and our partner network, teams bring iconic brands and new ideas to life through games, toys, entertainment and experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Teams and areas you may support&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on confirmed projects and business needs, your internship could align with one or more areas such as:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Brand and franchise marketing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Consumer insights and market research&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Digital, social and content marketing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Integrated campaigns and media&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Commercial and retail marketing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Marketing operations and performance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Examples of what you may work on&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on your placement, you may:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Use consumer, fan, cultural and performance insights to identify opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support campaign, content, launch or go-to-market planning and execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop briefs, presentations, recaps, toolkits or content for real brand initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Analyze campaign or market data and turn it into a clear story and recommendation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborate with Brand, Creative, Product, Sales, Finance, Insights and agency partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help improve a marketing process, channel or audience experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are currently enrolled in a university degree program in Marketing, Communications, Consumer Behavior, Business, Analytics, Media, Advertising or a related degree program.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A consumer-first mindset and curiosity about brands, culture and communities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clear communication and storytelling, supported by evidence and insight&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comfort balancing creative thinking with data, details and delivery&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to collaborate, adapt and keep learning as priorities and timelines change&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work samples:&lt;/strong&gt; No portfolio is required. Campaigns, research, content, student leadership or class projects may be linked if they strengthen your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Find your party: your global intern community&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Level up together.&lt;/strong&gt; All interns join one global cohort connected through shared, structured onboarding and weekly learning and development.&lt;/p&gt;
