&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relationship Management: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish connections with key contacts at the account and work on cultivating/developing strong customer relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regularly share insights and apply data to drive sell-in and sell-through&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of account KPIs and work to achieve mutually beneficial results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brand Expertise &amp;amp; Portfolio Management: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess a strong understanding of Hasbro brands, consumer targets, and product line&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create a curated product assortment for respective account base and present item recommendations to drive profitable growth and ultimately increase Hasbro points of distribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forecasting &amp;amp; Analytics&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accountable for delivering or exceeding sales targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for using data to accurately project sales and regularly communicating any changes to the plan as they occur&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Partnerships:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partners regularly with marketing, account support, flow planning and data management I m&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for ensuring all key parties assist in meeting various results and achievements throughout the selling process and POs are shipped on time and in full&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BA/BS Required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of transferrable experience and a proven track record to succeed in a fast-paced environment and achieve and exceed sales goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong internal and external relationship building/management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of retail metrics and proven analytical skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal communication and presentation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong time management, prioritization, planning, and organization skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sophisticated Excel/Powerpoint/PC skills&lt;/li&gt;
