&lt;li&gt;Commission a high volume of artwork by identifying freelance illustrators, providing ongoing art direction, maintaining strong partner relationships, and delivering regular status updates to the Lead Art Director and Producer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply a strong eye for detail and a solid understanding of artistic fundamentals to source and deliver high-quality artwork aligned with Dungeons &amp;amp; Dragons publishing schedules and brand standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with department leaders and participate in brainstorms focused on future Dungeons &amp;amp; Dragons creative initiatives and workflow/process improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present updates to leadership by showcasing work and clearly contextualizing it within the broader visual strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
