&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We&amp;nbsp;take play seriously. We’re looking for curious adventurers ready to find their party, fueled by imagination&amp;nbsp;and drive&amp;nbsp;to build what’s never been built before. At Hasbro and Wizards of the Coast, you’ll collaborate with passionate teams to reimagine our iconic brands and create experiences that spark joy, connection, and community through the magic of play. This is your chance to shape legendary play that lasts a lifetime.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Content is king/queen, and we ‘re looking for a monarch to come rule our communications with an iron fist! Must work well with others.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re searching for a Content Specialist dedicated to collaboration, information sharing, communication, words, and a love for showing our fans everything the world of Magic: The Gathering has to offer. Bonus points if you’ve already caught a grammatical error! The Communications team touches every part of Wizards of the Coast, so we weren’t kidding when we said you must work well with others.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A day in the life as Content Specialist:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Craft messaging to give our fans the information they need, when they need it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solicit, create, and edit exciting news and announcements about Magic: The Gathering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help run our content calendar across multiple web platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with experts, producers, designers, marketing professionals, and the people who make Magic the best game in the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An appetite for the written word, both crafting and refining (read: writing and editing)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A real passion for Magic, games, and our fans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative ideas for the best way to share information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating, editing, and leading content on the web&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment Details:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Please note that this is a temporary assignment through an external staffing agency. If you are selected for this assignment, you will be employed by Workwell as a W2 employee and will not be an employee of Wizards or Hasbro.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employment Type: Temporary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Renton, WA&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Duration: 12 months&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In compliance with local law, we are disclosing the hourly pay range and benefits available for this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hourly Pay Range: $35.00 - $45.00&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Benefits: Workwell offers temporary workers in the United States medical, dental, and vision coverage, as well as paid time off, holiday pay, a health savings account, an employee assistance program, a 401(k) retirement plan, and paid sick leave. Paid sick leave may vary by location.&lt;/p&gt;
