&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Associate&#39;s degree or Bachelor’s degree from accredited college or equivalent work experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant Law Firm or In-house corporate experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience interfacing with internal Engineering and Legal teams.&lt;/li&gt;
