&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We&amp;nbsp;take play seriously. We’re looking for curious adventurers ready to find their party, fueled by imagination&amp;nbsp;and drive&amp;nbsp;to build what’s never been built before. At Hasbro and Wizards of the Coast, you’ll collaborate with passionate teams to reimagine our iconic brands and create experiences that spark joy, connection, and community through the magic of play. This is your chance to shape legendary play that lasts a lifetime.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team: Global Applications – Information Technology&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hasbro is expanding its global digital capabilities with S/4HANA as the foundation of our enterprise operations. We are seeking a Senior Materials &amp;amp; Logistics Functional Lead to own and advance our global S/4HANA Materials Management (MM), Inventory Management (IM), and Logistics Execution (LE) processes. This is a forward-looking role focused on building modern, scalable supply chain capabilities to support our growing Direct-to-Consumer and B2B operations worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will serve as the lead strategist and solution owner for procurement, inbound and outbound logistics, warehousing, and inventory processes. This role plays a key part in defining standards, shaping the roadmap, and ensuring that our S/4HANA capabilities drive operational excellence across Hasbro’s global supply chain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Lead&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the global process owner for S/4HANA MM/IM/LE, promoting adoption of S/4HANA-native functionality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and maintain global process standards, documentation, and best practices across procurement, warehousing, logistics, and inventory management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead continuous improvement initiatives that enhance accuracy, scalability, and efficiency in supply chain operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Hasbro’s global digital roadmap across Direct-to-Consumer and Business-to-Business channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Design &amp;amp; Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business strategies into scalable, S/4HANA-native functional designs for procurement, warehouse operations, goods movement, and outbound logistics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate future-state design sessions that emphasize S/4HANA simplification concepts and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee configuration, enhancements, and testing activities across the MM/LE landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and coordinate User Acceptance Testing, ensuring business alignment and readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Procurement, Logistics, Warehousing, Finance, Sales, and other functions to deliver integrated end-to-end supply chain processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide external consultants, developers, and functional peers to ensure cohesive solution delivery across modules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support integrations with 3PL providers, Transportation Management Systems, Freight Payment systems, and other partners using IDoc, BAPI, ALE, and SAP Integration Suite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Governance &amp;amp; Continuous Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain functional documentation, SOPs, and training materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive standardization of business processes and development practices across the Global Applications team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead initiatives that streamline material flows, improve warehouse efficiency, and optimize delivery and shipment processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of SAP MM/IM/LE configuration and functional solution design experience, with direct S/4HANA exposure preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of procurement, materials management, inventory control, warehouse processes, and outbound logistics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise across key S/4HANA MM/LE functions, including Purchase Requisitions, Purchase Orders, Stock Transport Orders, Release Strategies, Goods Issue/Receipt, Delivery &amp;amp; Shipment Processing, and Warehouse Management concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with adjacent modules (Finance, SD) and end-to-end supply chain flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead cross-functional teams and influence stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree preferred or equivalent experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why This Role Matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is critical to Hasbro’s global supply chain strategy and offers the opportunity to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own next-generation S/4HANA MM/LE processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead digital transformation across procurement, warehousing, and logistics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthen operational excellence across global D2C and B2B channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure S/4HANA becomes a strategic driver of business value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will play an essential role in modernizing how Hasbro manages materials, inventory, and logistics in a rapidly evolving digital supply chain ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot; data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;The pay transparency range for this role is listed below. The hiring range will vary based on factors such as experience, skills, location and market conditions. Additionally, employees may be eligible for annual and long-term incentives as part of their overall compensation package.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$107,800&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$161,700 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Employees may be eligible for annual and long-term incentives as part of their overall compensation package, depending on role, location, and eligibility. Benefits and programs may include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
