&lt;li&gt;Represent the company behind Magic: The Gathering and Dungeons &amp;amp; Dragons at regional trade shows, conventions, and retailer events as required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in retail development, channel sales, account management, or distributor/partner management, ideally within gaming, hobby, toy, or FMCG retail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record to manage a multi-market or multi-country portfolio independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the tabletop gaming, trading card game (TCG), or collectible hobby retail landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing network of retail contacts in one or more of the covered markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience working within a global brand&#39;s regional field team, reporting to an offshore manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-cultural interpersonal skills; comfortable working across markets with differing languages and business norms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness and ability to undertake frequent travel across APAC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
